OL,3,AHeathrow and Gatwick among airports hit
OL,4,Aby air traffic control problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith few aircraft able to take off, it
OL,7,Fis understood landings are being
OL,8,Frestricted, leading to some flights
OL,9,Fbeing prevented from departing from
OL,10,Foverseas airports.
